{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791100577,"nonce":"GxuYncB4TZiuq/knmsAsNWsEs88=","title":"ashui.components: a shadcn-style component library, CSS-first, on signals","message":"User direction (2026-10-04): a side library in this repo, namespace ashui.components, cn-like components, better than blinc_cn, whose CSS overrides came after the fact. Signals and computeds only, no stateful closures.\n\nDesign: components/haxe on its own class path; every look in components/css/components.css (embedded at compile time, put in force by Css.useLibrary under the page's sheets); components set classes (ui-\u003cpart\u003e), data- attributes bound to computeds (Identity.bindAttribute) and interaction states, never own visual props; each component reads --ui-\u003ccomponent\u003e-\u003cprop\u003e with fallback to theme tokens. hxx: an imported component wins over a built-in tag of its name; attributes a component does not take go to its root (class adds classes, style and layout bind).\n\nFirst batch: Button, Badge, Card (+ header, title, description, content, footer), Alert (+ title, description), Separator, Avatar (+ image, fallback), Skeleton, Spinner, ToggleSwitch (switch is a keyword hxx keeps), Tabs (+ list, trigger, content), Tooltip.\nNext, on the FSM engine and FLIP layout animation: Accordion, Collapsible, Dialog/AlertDialog, Sheet, Popover, DropdownMenu, Select, Combobox, Toast, Slider, Progress, Toggle/ToggleGroup, RadioGroup, Checkbox, Input, Textarea, Label, Breadcrumb, Pagination, Table, ScrollArea, NavigationMenu, Menubar, ContextMenu, HoverCard, Command, Calendar.","files":null}]}